## Repo Structure Standard

Every Yingson Labs repo must follow this structure:

```
service-name/
├── .cursor/
│   └── rules/
│       ├── yingson-labs-context.mdc   ← environment + git + never-do
│       └── feature-documentation-required.mdc  ← no feature without docs
├── .gitattributes
├── .gitignore
├── .env.example                        ← committed, no real values
├── CURSOR.md                           ← session briefing doc
├── README.md
├── ARCHITECTURE.md
├── CHANGELOG.md
├── docs/
│   ├── documentation-standards.md      ← extends lab-standards
│   ├── setup-gitea-git.md
│   ├── runbook.md (or runbooks/)
│   └── decisions/
│       └── ADR-001-[decision-name].md
├── scripts/
│   └── (operational scripts, clearly named)
└── src/ (or service-appropriate structure)
```

